{"name":"Folk Horror","title":"Folk Horror","revision":235506,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Folk_Horror","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Folk Horror is a subgenre of horror that is based around folklore and urban legends. Many stories of the genre would often center around a protagonist in lone rural areas, encountering malevolent entities. It is similar to Catholic Horror as it incorporates elements such as demons, cults and depictions of the devil, but focuses more on the supernatural and fear of the unknown."},{"kind":"heading","text":"History"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"TBA"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visuals"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Visually, Folk Horror characterized as dark, unsettling and mysterious. Many works in the genre take place in remote areas close to nature like rural towns or houses in the woods."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Movies"},{"kind":"list","text":"Viy (1967)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Witchfinder General (1968)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Blood on Satan's Claw (1971)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Wicker Man (1973)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Witch (2015)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Haguzussa: A Heathen's Curse (2017)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Midsommar (2019)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Woodlands Dark and Days Bewitched: History of Folk Horror (2021)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Men (2022)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Video Games"},{"kind":"list","text":"Burrow Hill (2006)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Darkwood (2014)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Munduan (2021)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Excavation of Hob's Barrow (2022)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Television"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Third Day (2020)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Books"},{"kind":"list","text":"Slewfoot: A Tale of Witchery by Brom"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Lottery by Shirley Jackson"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Ritual by Adam Nevill"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/d/d0/In-the-EarthR-cropped-the-picture-in-Zacks-camp-40-48.webp/revision/latest?cb=20260418035909","caption":"In-the-EarthR-cropped-the-picture-in-Zacks-camp-40-48","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:In-the-EarthR-cropped-the-picture-in-Zacks-camp-40-48.webp","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0383-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/9/94/Tumblr_ced4419135c9f76170f3da0d6e9e4e52_86f9d69a_1280.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20260313035319","caption":"Folk Horror · Visual reference 02","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tumblr_ced4419135c9f76170f3da0d6e9e4e52_86f9d69a_1280.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0383-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}